    <guid isPermaLink="false">69290111f2b1671798224fb6</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Nov 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们终于来填花少的坑啦！这一季，我们尝试“边看边聊”新模式，穿插节目原声，给大家带来兼具真实性，即时性的陪伴式reaction。希望大家听得开心！欢迎留言跟我们互动，也期待你分享想看的节目内容，话不多说，节目正式开始！</span></p><span></span><p><span>⭐️时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a>桑桑和榆钱本季最感兴趣的嘉宾是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 正片开始！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> &nbsp;节目组被“搞怕了”？提前50天开制作会，求生欲拉满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a> 同心厨房大作战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1142">19:02</a> 熟悉的项目：选导游环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 先导片观后感总结：这一季，稳了还是悬了？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：《花儿与少年·同心季》主题曲</span></p>]]></description>
