  <item>
    <title>EP09 浙江漫谈 | 温州、衢州之旅与朋友对谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68731f7c60f8f77d403481bb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68731f7c60f8f77d403481bb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Jul 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>桑桑和榆钱五月底开启了一周的温州、衢州之旅。本期是两位主播首次线下面对面录制，前半程畅聊旅途见闻（景点体验、美食盘点），后半程展开朋友间的深度对话。整期氛围轻松愉快，充满欢笑，欢迎收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟 时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 聊天开始，搬好小板凳～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a>旅途中最惊艳的美食？(衢州麻辣烫/温州瘦肉丸/杏仁腐/衢州蛋卷/酵声面包)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="233">03:53</a> 最推荐的景点？(百丈漈瀑布群 / 衢州的城市氛围)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a> 发现彼此的新变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="632">10:32</a> 旅途中最难忘的三个瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="768">12:48</a> 复盘一场“可爱”的吵架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1371">22:51</a> 话题探讨：审美品味是如何形成的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1555">25:55</a> 话题探讨：朋友间的过度坦诚会成为负担吗？关于INFJ的过度思考的迷思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2195">36:35</a> 旅程总结：一场身心舒适的完美旅途</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 BGM： 久石让 - 《Summer》</span></p>]]></description>
