    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🌟时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a> 第二期总览</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="284">04:44</a> 打包行李欢乐多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 车上的梗王小胡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="562">09:22</a> 去阿拉伯友人Nora家参观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">14:04</a> 体验沙特当地服饰，学习语言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a> 送礼物环节，卷王老王哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1806">30:06</a> 晚餐环节，女明星的自律</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 林荫大道步行街</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2878">47:58</a> 回酒店轮流洗澡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3337">55:37</a> 转战埃尔奥拉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3519">58:39</a> 入住节目组准备的豪华酒店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4174">1:09:34</a> 我们从花少团身上学习到什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：《花儿与少年·丝路季》主题曲</span></p>]]></description>
